	// (departureTime - tb) < bus_departure_time < arrivalTime
	// Because:
	// - A bus departing from B at time t arrives at A at time t + tb
	// - Simion departs A at departureTime and arrives at B at arrivalTime
	// - They meet if the bus from B departs after (departureTime - tb) and before arrivalTime
	// - We exclude buses that depart exactly at departureTime - tb (would meet at A)
	// - We exclude buses that depart exactly at arrivalTime (would meet at B)

	start := departureTime - tb + 1
